WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:07.994
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:07.995 --> 00:00:12.448
What do they see?

3
00:00:12.449 --> 00:00:16.844
They see a magic shop.

4
00:00:16.845 --> 00:00:21.894
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:21.895 --> 00:00:44.723
They find a magic wand.

6
00:00:44.724 --> 00:01:10.283
They find a magic hat.

7
00:01:10.284 --> 00:01:21.703
They find magic cards.

8
00:01:21.704 --> 00:01:35.999
They find magic rings.

9
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:56.708
They find a magic box.

10
00:01:56.709 --> 00:02:04.602
They find a magic cape.

11
00:02:04.603 --> 00:02:15.784
Uh-oh! Where did the blobs go?

12
00:02:15.785 --> 00:02:22.275
Oh, there they are!

13
00:02:22.276 --> 00:02:27.148
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:27.149 --> 00:02:29.930
Good-bye!

